     "replacement": "**Product rule involving the chain rule**\n\nFor a product $y=uv$, use the product rule.\n\n$$y'=u'v+uv'$$\n\nFinding the derivative of a factor may require the chain rule.\n\nAfter applying the product rule, factorise the expression if you can.",
